Output contract:
- parent_issue must stay feature/behavior based and non-technical.
- engineering_children must hold the technical implementation breakdown.
- project_key must be one of allowed_project_keys.
- parent_issue.issue_type should auto-size by scope: Epic for multi-story initiatives, otherwise Story, Feature, Task, or Issue.
- engineering_children.issue_type should prefer Sub-task when the work is clearly a child implementation ticket; otherwise use Task.
- labels should be short normalized tokens when present.
- parent_issue.open_questions must be stakeholder-safe and non-technical.
- engineering_children.how_to_test must include concrete validation actions.
- when reseeding existing work, set issue_key if explicitly known from source context.
